
  [1mThe fork:[0m whether this app has a server or not. It decides essentially everything downstream and is expensive to
  reverse.

  - [1mSingle-user, browser-only[0m — tasks live in [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m, "notification" means in-page toasts plus maybe the browser
    Notification API. Cheap, no infra. But "users" collapses to one person, so "tasks they care about" has no real
