    rewrite.
  - [1mClient + backend, multi-user[0m — real accounts, a task store, server-side change detection, a notifications table, and
    delivery channels. This is what the request literally describes. Costs a server, a DB, auth, and a much larger
    build.
  - [1mClient-only now, backend-shaped[0m — build the browser app but put change detection behind a small event/subscription
    interface so a server can be swapped in. Buys optionality at the cost of some indirection you may never use.

